## Project Structure

```
{{ model.names.namespace }}/
├── src/
│   └── {{ model.names.namespace }}/
│       ├── Auth/               — API key authentication handler
│       ├── Data/               — EF Core DbContext and entities (if DB enabled)
│       ├── Interceptors/       — gRPC interceptors (validation, observability)
│       ├── Models/             — Domain models and configuration options
│       ├── Protos/             — Proto definitions → regenerate stubs with dotnet build
│       └── Services/           — gRPC service implementations (your domain code goes here)
├── tests/
│   └── {{ model.names.namespace }}.Tests/
│       ├── TestBase.cs         — WebApplicationFactory base for integration tests
│       └── ...                 — Your test files
├── .claude/
│   ├── CLAUDE.md               — Service identity and context for Claude Code
│   └── guides/                 — Standards and patterns
├── Dockerfile
├── .env.example                — All config keys with documentation
└── stryker-config.json         — Mutation testing configuration
```

