## CI/CD

CI runs on every PR to `main` or `develop`. Pipeline jobs:

| Job | What it checks |
|---|---|
| `build-test` | Format, build, vulnerability scan, test (90% coverage gate), SBOM |
| `secrets-scan` | gitleaks — no committed secrets |
| `codeql` | SAST — security vulnerabilities in .NET code |
| `trivy` | Container image scan — OS and library CVEs |
